Mexican “Bud” look-alike sneak over the border, so he can take a break from his own life."}]},{"id":85130,"number":9,"name":"Heart Attack","plot":"Gert’s unhealthy eating causes her to have a heart attack during the Little Miss Mexifornia Pageant. Unable to afford the surgery in America, Bud takes her to Mexico to have her arteries unblocked and heart repaired. Meanwhile, Ernesto and Maria put Pepito on medication that makes him behave, but they don’t like the side effects.","duration":25,"scws_id":287104,"season_id":6682,"created_at":"2025-02-17T15:24:47.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:40:35.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":1,"sub_ita":0,"uploaded_at":"2025-02-17 16:24:47","images":[{"id":151274,"filename":"cce7ed80-7c43-4aa0-a160-073eb84115cc.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":85130,"created_at":"2025-02-17T15:24:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T15:24:48.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/cce7ed80-7c43-4aa0-a160-073eb84115cc.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":246478,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":85130,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Heart Attack"},{"id":246479,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":85130,"locale":"it","key":"plot","value":"Gert’s unhealthy eating causes her to have a heart attack during the Little Miss Mexifornia Pageant. Unable to afford the surgery in America, Bud takes her to Mexico to have her arteries unblocked and heart repaired. Meanwhile, Ernesto and Maria put Pepito on medication that makes him behave, but they don’t like the side effects."}]},{"id":85198,"number":10,"name":"Wildfire","plot":"Residents are ordered to leave Mexifornia when it is threatened by wildfire, but Bud stays put and his house catches fire, requiring Ernesto to rescue him. Meanwhile J.C. and Becky take a relationship break and agree to see other people.","duration":25,"scws_id":287105,"season_id":6682,"created_at":"2025-02-17T15:29:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:40:35.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":1,"sub_ita":0,"uploaded_at":"2025-02-17 16:29:56","images":[{"id":151356,"filename":"dd40a168-3405-4e6a-95ca-c0c317cf07f1.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":85198,"created_at":"2025-02-17T15:29:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T15:29:56.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/dd40a168-3405-4e6a-95ca-c0c317cf07f1.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":246611,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":85198,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Wildfire"},{"id":246612,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":85198,"locale":"it","key":"plot","value":"Residents are ordered to leave Mexifornia when it is threatened by wildfire, but Bud stays put and his house catches fire, requiring Ernesto to rescue him. Meanwhile J.C. and Becky take a relationship break and agree to see other people."}]},{"id":85131,"number":11,"name":"La Fiesta Noche Show","plot":"Ernesto and Placido are thrilled that their favorite TV show, “La Fiesta Noche,” will be filming in Mexifornia. The Buckwalds and Gonzalezes both get tickets to the taping, but Bud’s anger at the spectacle causes him to be called onto the stage. Much to everyone’s surprise, the audience loves him and he becomes a big star in the Mexican community in the all-new “La Fiesta Noche Show”","duration":25,"scws_id":287106,"season_id":6682,"created_at":"2025-02-17T15:24:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:40:35.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":1,"sub_ita":0,"uploaded_at":"2025-02-17 16:24:48","images":[{"id":151275,"filename":"094721c3-4933-4495-a329-87c10aab0757.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":85131,"created_at":"2025-02-17T15:24:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T15:24:48.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/094721c3-4933-4495-a329-87c10aab0757.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":246480,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":85131,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"La Fiesta Noche Show"},{"id":246481,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":85131,"locale":"it","key":"plot","value":"Ernesto and Placido are thrilled that their favorite TV show, “La Fiesta Noche,” will be filming in Mexifornia. The Buckwalds and Gonzalezes both get tickets to the taping, but Bud’s anger at the spectacle causes him to be called onto the stage. Much to everyone’s surprise, the audience loves him and he becomes a big star in the Mexican community in the all-new “La Fiesta Noche Show”"}]},{"id":85199,"number":12,"name":"American Doll","plot":"Janice secretly maxes out her credit card in the purchase of an American Gal doll and accessories and takes a job as Ernesto's housekeeper to earn some extra cash. Bud, however puts in motion a plan to get her fired, while Gert seeks revenge on the American Gal company.","duration":25,"scws_id":287107,"season_id":6682,"created_at":"2025-02-17T15:29:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:40:35.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":1,"sub_ita":0,"uploaded_at":"2025-02-17 16:29:57","images":[{"id":151357,"filename":"a68698e4-723d-4891-93a6-6033dbaed52e.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":85199,"created_at":"2025-02-17T15:29:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T15:29:57.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/a68698e4-723d-4891-93a6-6033dbaed52e.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":246613,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":85199,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"American Doll"},{"id":246614,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":85199,"locale":"it","key":"plot","value":"Janice secretly maxes out her credit card in the purchase of an American Gal doll and accessories and takes a job as Ernesto's housekeeper to earn some extra cash. Bud, however puts in motion a plan to get her fired, while Gert seeks revenge on the American Gal company."}]},{"id":85132,"number":13,"name":"Viva Coyote","plot":"When El Coyote is moved to the No. 1 spot on the \"Most Wanted\" list, Bud and Barracuda go gunning for him: Bud because he let him slip across the border; Barracuda because he seeks to regain the top slot on the list. Meanwhile, Ruiz wants to free El Coyote so that an attractive waitress will see him as \"more Mexican.\"","duration":25,"scws_id":287108,"season_id":6682,"created_at":"2025-02-17T15:24:49.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:40:35.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":1,"sub_ita":0,"uploaded_at":"2025-02-17 16:24:49","images":[{"id":151276,"filename":"5475b780-9c43-468d-8f3d-fb012f5c6099.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":85132,"created_at":"2025-02-17T15:24:49.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T15:24:49.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/5475b780-9c43-468d-8f3d-fb012f5c6099.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":246482,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":85132,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Viva Coyote"},{"id":246483,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":85132,"locale":"it","key":"plot","value":"When El Coyote is moved to the No. 1 spot on the \"Most Wanted\" list, Bud and Barracuda go gunning for him: Bud because he let him slip across the border; Barracuda because he seeks to regain the top slot on the list. Meanwhile, Ruiz wants to free El Coyote so that an attractive waitress will see him as \"more Mexican.\""}]}],"path":"/it/titles/11323-bordertown/season-1","images":[]},{"id":18275,"number":2,"name":"Stagione 2","plot":null,"release_date":null,"title_id":11323,"created_at":"2025-12-01T13:36:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T13:36:10.000000Z","release_date_it":null,"translations":[{"id":650987,"translatable_type":"season","translatable_id":18275,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Stagione 2"}],"episodes":[{"id":2214